  "description": "Everyday or leisure, road or off-road - the Sonic SX Dakar offers riding fun at the highest level everywhere. The combination of the highly developed Sonic carbon frame and the particularly light, powerful and natural Bosch drivetrain SX forms the basis for an outstanding e-MTB with complete road equipment and uncompromising features. This includes the RockShox air suspension fork, the Shimano Deore XT 12-speed gears, the dropper seat post and the high-quality Mavic wheels with Schwalbe G-One Allround tyres. The compact Bosch drivetrains drive, which is characterised by the lowest possible pedalling resistance, is controlled via the combination of remote handlebar grip and system controller in the top tube. Together, this results in a high-end E-MTB that is fully suitable for everyday use with road equipment and MonkeyLink lighting.",
